# Build context for the dashboard and admin images (both build with `web` as
# their context). The two static sites are workspace members but never ship in
# an SSR image, so their sources stay out of the context entirely; only their
# package.json survives, because `bun install --frozen-lockfile` re-resolves the
# whole workspace graph and refuses to run when a member named in bun.lock has
# no manifest on disk.
marketing/*
!marketing/package.json
docs/*
!docs/package.json

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.svelte-kit
**/.astro
**/test-results
**/*.log
